# Fixture videos: large, and some source datasets are licence-restricted
# (see fixtures/README.md). Sidecar JSON and the README stay tracked — they
# are the ground truth. The three tiny hand-made example clips are kept as
# explicit exceptions so a fresh clone has something real to load.
fixtures/**/*.mov
!fixtures/barbell_back_squat.mov
!fixtures/dumbbell_row.mov
!fixtures/bodyweight_pushup.mov

